'''''Poet, Speak of the Sky Through Me (II)''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[The Fall at Dawn's Rise]].

==Steps==
# Defeat "Eye of Twilight" Aquila
# Use the Shrine of Prayers to Rewind the shattered platform
# Escape the Cloudedge Bastion Ruins!
# Try using the Miracle Orb to pass through the curtain wall
# Continue onward and escape the falling Cloudedge Bastion Ruins
# Try using the Miracle Orb to pass through the curtain wall
# Continue onward and escape the falling Cloudedge Bastion Ruins
# Ride the platform and return to the domed roof of the Cloudedge Bastion Ruins
# Escape the Cloudedge Bastion Ruins!

