:'''Phainon:''' The truth of the legend... is finally clear.
:'''Phainon:''' Hyacinthia...
:'''Hyacine:''' ...
:'''Hyacine:''' Am I... the descendant of that nameless Chrysos Heir?
:'''Hyacine:''' Our lineage wasn't from the hero...
:'''Hyacine:''' ...but from a nameless Chrysos Heir who begged for mercy before her.
:'''Hyacine:''' My whole clan's fragile mortal life... was simply spared on Seliose's whim...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We must not yield to her scorn.
::'''Phainon:''' Her judgment may be true &mdash; mortals do have their flaws. But even so, human dignity must not be trampled.
::Humans aren't as contemptible as she thinks.
::'''Phainon:''' She sees only the sins we've committed, but we will make her understand that it's not all we are.
::Perhaps there's a trace of compassion left in her.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Humans aren't as contemptible as she thinks.
::'''Phainon:''' She sees only the sins we've committed, but we will make her understand that it's not all we are.
::Perhaps there's a trace of compassion left in her.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Perhaps there's a trace of compassion left in her.
:'''Phainon:''' She turned her back on humanity and embraced divinity... She believes we're not worth saving.
:'''Hyacine:''' Lord Solabis, Lady Lunabis &mdash;
:{{tx}}
