:'''Message Slate:''' Dear Seliose,
:'''Message Slate:''' Are you okay? '''We''' haven't heard from you in so long...
:'''Message Slate:''' '''We''' think '''we''' understand why you haven't replied, but '''we''' still wanted to leave these words here, just in case you see them, you know?
:'''Message Slate:''' '''We''' are afraid this might be the last letter '''we''' ever write to you. Oleinus has sunk into an endless night, with dreadful creatures continuing to surge from the black tide, plunging the entire city in chaos.
:'''Message Slate:''' Right now, I'm doing everything I can to help people escape. '''We''' have been guiding them through the Century Gate, sending them to Okhema, where '''our''' sister Tribbie is waiting.
:'''Message Slate:''' Maintaining the Century Gate takes everything I have. Lately, it feels like '''we''' are getting smaller and smaller. And to make matters worse, the lord of Oleinus is still closing in on '''us'''...
:'''Message Slate:''' Yet '''we''' can't stop now. There are still so many people who need saving.
:'''Message Slate:''' '''We''' have to get them to safety, far from the grasp of the black tide. It's something '''we''' can't turn away from. Any of '''our''' sisters would make the same choice without a second thought...
:'''Message Slate:''' Dear Seliose &mdash; have you become a hero? '''We''' truly hope you've succeeded. If you have, perhaps more people will believe in the prophecy... and find the strength to stand together because of it.
:'''Message Slate:''' '''We''' are so tired now. Maybe it's time for a little rest... and in '''our''' dreams, '''we''' will see Mama again, along with all '''our''' sisters...
:'''Message Slate:''' &mdash; Missing you, Trissha

{{Dialogue End}}

